      "value": "@{5eff476248ee5765bbf3f17a|full_name}: I know what you're getting at, but that is because world authors aren't making their functions/methods non-networkable or private. I've already sanitized my functions and the hackers cannot call the methods at all.(Simply add \"_\" at the start of the method or event name. With or without hackers we need these kick/ban functions pronto. It's time to stop being a \"carebear\" community to the trolls that take up spots in a map and troll.",
